      "content": "hey, i'm prepping for a seminar on retributive vs restorative justice. in the context of modern social justice movements, which framework—retributive justice (punishment-based) or restorative justice (rehabilitation-based)—has the more morally sound foundation? Or is one just objectively better for a modern society? moved toward the restorative side",
